      "Coordinate Cargo 11, Cargo 9, Cargo 15, Cargo 4, and Cargo 10: ascend together to 25 meters, establish pentagon formation at positions (496, 394, 25), (670, 393, 25), (708, 570, 25), (704, 569, 25), and (514, 577, 25) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 98m followed by east 104m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 98m, east 104m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Five-drone formation drill: launch Cargo 11, Cargo 9, Cargo 15, Cargo 4, and Cargo 10 to altitude 25m, hold stations at (496, 394, 25), (670, 393, 25), (708, 570, 25), (704, 569, 25), and (514, 577, 25) respectively, then shift north by 98 meters and east by 104 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute synchronized operation with Cargo 11, Cargo 9, Cargo 15, Cargo 4, Cargo 10: take off reaching 25 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (496, 394, 25), (670, 393, 25), (708, 570, 25), (704, 569, 25), and (514, 577, 25) respectively, then proceed north for 98m and subsequently east for 104m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Five-drone coordinated maneuver: Cargo 11, Cargo 9, Cargo 15, Cargo 4, and Cargo 10 lift off to 25m elevation, hold formation positions at (496, 394, 25), (670, 393, 25), (708, 570, 25), (704, 569, 25), and (514, 577, 25) respectively, then travel north 98 meters and east 104 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
