    "id": "2549cb89",
    "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (3 Drones) 1",
    "content": "Three-drone coordination exercise: Cargo 6, Cargo 3, and Cargo 10 take off together to 16 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (629, 539, 16), (744, 533, 16), and (432, 652, 16) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all three drones move north for 74m, and next move east for 52m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 74m, then east 52m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Cargo 6, Cargo 3, and Cargo 10: ascend together to 16 meters, establish formation at positions (629, 539, 16), (744, 533, 16), and (432, 652, 16) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 74m followed by east 52m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 74m, east 52m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Three-drone formation drill: launch Cargo 6, Cargo 3, and Cargo 10 to altitude 16m, hold stations at (629, 539, 16), (744, 533, 16), and (432, 652, 16) respectively, then shift north by 74 meters and east by 52 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute synchronized operation with Cargo 6, Cargo 3, Cargo 10: take off reaching 16 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (629, 539, 16), (744, 533, 16), and (432, 652, 16) respectively, then proceed north for 74m and subsequently east for 52m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Three-drone coordinated maneuver: Cargo 6, Cargo 3, and Cargo 10 lift off to 16m elevation, hold formation positions at (629, 539, 16), (744, 533, 16), and (432, 652, 16) respectively, then travel north 74 meters and east 52 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
