  {
    "id": "5eb64241",
    "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (5 Drones) 1",
    "content": "Five-drone target sweep: Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 09, Relief UAV 03, Relief UAV 04, and Relief UAV 08 take off together to 25 meters altitude. Relief UAV 10 flies to target Civilian Damage Survey 1, Relief UAV 09 flies to target Housing damage assessment 05, Relief UAV 03 flies to target Relief Rendezvous 2, Relief UAV 04 flies to target Drainage access assessment 08, and Relief UAV 08 flies to target Civilian Charging Point 2. After reaching the targets, all five drones move west for 104m, then south for 108m, then north for 62m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 104m, south 108m, north 62m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 09, Relief UAV 03, Relief UAV 04, and Relief UAV 08: ascend together to 25 meters altitude, send Relief UAV 10 to target Civilian Damage Survey 1, Relief UAV 09 to target Housing damage assessment 05, Relief UAV 03 to target Relief Rendezvous 2, Relief UAV 04 to target Drainage access assessment 08, and Relief UAV 08 to target Civilian Charging Point 2, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 104m, south 108m, and north 62m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 104m, south 108m, north 62m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Five-drone target sweep operation: launch Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 09, Relief UAV 03, Relief UAV 04, and Relief UAV 08 to altitude 25m, navigate to targets Civilian Damage Survey 1, Housing damage assessment 05, Relief Rendezvous 2, Drainage access assessment 08, Civilian Charging Point 2 respectively, then shift west by 104 meters, south by 108 meters, and north by 62 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute five-drone sweep mission: Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 09, Relief UAV 03, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 08 take off reaching 25 meters height, fly to targets Civilian Damage Survey 1, Housing damage assessment 05, Relief Rendezvous 2, Drainage access assessment 08, Civilian Charging Point 2 respectively, then proceed west for 104m, subsequently south for 108m, and finally north for 62m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Five-drone coordinated target mission: Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 09, Relief UAV 03, Relief UAV 04, and Relief UAV 08 lift off to 25m elevation, reach targets Civilian Damage Survey 1, Housing damage assessment 05, Relief Rendezvous 2, Drainage access assessment 08, Civilian Charging Point 2 respectively, then travel west 104 meters, south 108 meters, and north 62 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
